  2 = max bonds/atom
  scanning angles ...
  1 = max angles/atom
  orthogonal box = (0 0 0) to (24.8 24.8 24.8)
  4 by 4 by 8 MPI processor grid
  reading bonds ...
  1024 bonds
  reading angles ...
  512 angles
